# JFDiagrammer, JD9: shapes onto the page (SL-03, MS-02, LG-04) -- click + click, drag and
# drop, Enter on a tile; the master comes into the drawing once, each instance gets the name in
# the current language (the second one "Rechteck.N"); the first shape makes the empty drawing a
# document with a page
click button:"Weitere Shapes"
click "Allgemein"
click "Standard-Shapes"
# click + click: the tile is armed (checked) until the click on the page
click button:"Rechteck"
expect button:"Rechteck" checked
click canvas:"Zeichenfläche"
a11y expect announced "„Rechteck“ abgelegt"
expect button:"Rechteck" unchecked
expect tab:"Seite-1" exists
expect button:"Seite 1 von 1" exists
# Esc disarms without placing
click button:"Raute"
expect button:"Raute" checked
key esc
expect button:"Raute" unchecked
# drag and drop
drag button:"Ellipse" canvas:"Zeichenfläche"
a11y expect announced "„Ellipse“ abgelegt"
# the same master again: one copy of it in the drawing, the instance named with its ID
drag button:"Rechteck" canvas:"Zeichenfläche"
a11y expect announced "„Rechteck.6“ abgelegt"
# Enter on a tile: the middle of the view
focus button:"Pfeil"
key enter
a11y expect announced "„Pfeil“ abgelegt"
shot build/JFDiagrammer-stencils-drop.png
